# Nightscape FM's map: Seed beside Dream (Setup, SELECT held); the bells' Colour on KNOB 4; a knob says when something
# else drives it (Drift: Chords; Seed and Deal: Dream, until a hand turns them); SELECT held marks the page (+, or - where
# there is no second layer) and dashes an empty place; the dream's number in the header; a card for SELECT.
wait 5000
listen
tap ARP
wait 1500
said Colour Bell
tap HOME
wait 300
press SEL
wait 300
shot garden_held.png
spin K1 1
spin K1 -1
release SEL
wait 200
tap SEQ
wait 300
press SEL
wait 300
shot pulse_held.png
spin K1 1
spin K1 -1
release SEL
wait 200
# the slate drives the chords: Drift says so, and a turn says where they are
tap SEL
wait 200
spin K1 1
wait 100
expect par28 1
tap HOME
wait 1500
said Drift Chords
spin K4 3
wait 100
said Chords page
expect par6 25
tap SEL
wait 200
expect view 8
spin K1 -1
wait 100
expect par28 0
# Dream drives Seed and the dealers; a hand on Seed has it back
tap GLO
wait 300
press SEL
wait 300
spin K1 1
wait 100
expect par67 1
shot setup_held.png
spin K1 1
wait 100
expect dreamkept 1
release SEL
wait 200
tap SEL
wait 200
tap SEL
wait 200
tap SEL
wait 1500
expect view 10
said Deal Dream
tap GLO
wait 300
press SEL
wait 300
spin K4 1
wait 100
release SEL
wait 300
shot header.png
# SELECT's card: a long hold, nothing turned
tap HOME
wait 300
press SEL
wait 2200
shot select_card.png
said SELECT
release SEL
wait 200
expect view 0
